---
layout: base.njk
title: Facility
description: >-
  The HUBS Laboratory in Room CE 116 at the University of Arizona — two
  reconfigurable environmental chambers, a control room, and dense multi-modal
  instrumentation for occupant comfort, IEQ and HVAC research.
ogImage: /assets/facility/HUBS_lab_inside_01.webp
---
{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}
{% macro tone(p) %}{{ 'c-hu' if p == 'human' else ('c-ai' if p == 'ai' else 'c-bl') }}{% endmacro %}

<section class="pageHero wrap">
  <p class="label">Facility</p>
  <h1>HUBS Living Lab.</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ facility.intro }}</p>
  <p class="label" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
    {{ facility.location.room }} · {{ facility.location.address }} · {{ facility.location.campus }}
  </p>
</section>

{% if facility.positioning %}
<section class="band band--tight wrap">
  <div class="measure">
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink-2)">{{ facility.positioning }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ===== Zones ====================================================== -->
{% if facility.zones.length %}
<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="band__head measure">
    <p class="label">Layout</p>
    <h2>Three zones, independently controlled.</h2>
    <p class="lede">{{ facility.zonesNote }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid--2">
    {%- for z in facility.zones %}
    <div class="card">
      <div class="zoneHead">
        <p class="card__head {{ tone(z.party) | trim }}" style="margin:0">{{ z.name }}</p>
        <span class="zoneSize">{{ z.size }}</span>
      </div>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-2);font-size:.95rem;margin:.9rem 0 1rem">{{ z.summary }}</p>
      <ul>{%- for d in z.details %}<li>{{ d }}</li>{%- endfor %}</ul>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ===== Photographs ================================================ -->
{% if facility.photos.length %}
<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="band__head measure">
    <p class="label">The space</p>
  </div>
  <div class="photoGrid">
    {%- for p in facility.photos %}
    <figure>
      <img src="/assets/facility/{{ p.file }}" alt="{{ p.caption }}" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>{{ p.caption }}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ===== Capability ================================================= -->
<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="band__head measure">
    <p class="label">Capability</p>
    <h2>What we can measure, and what we can move.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      The three corners of the triangle need different hardware — sensing for the
      human, compute for the agent, actuation for the building. The lab carries
      all three.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid--2">
    {%- for g in facility.capability %}
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head {{ tone(g.party) | trim }}">{{ g.group }}</p>
      {% if g.note %}<p class="label" style="margin-bottom:.9rem">{{ g.note }}</p>{% endif %}
      <ul>{%- for it in g.items %}<li>{{ it }}</li>{%- endfor %}</ul>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Research modes ============================================= -->
{% if facility.modes.length %}
<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="band__head measure">
    <p class="label">Research modes</p>
    <h2>Four ways the lab gets configured.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="modes">
    {%- for m in facility.modes %}
    <article>
      <h3>{{ m.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ m.text }}</p>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ===== Collaborate ================================================ -->
{% if facility.collaborate %}
<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="cta">
    <p class="label">Collaborate</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:.8rem">Open to visiting researchers.</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-2);max-width:54ch;margin-top:1rem">{{ facility.collaborate }}</p>
    <div class="btnRow">
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">Email Dr. Jung {{ icon("arrow-right") }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/research/">See the research</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
